22:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body ","children":[false,[["$","section","Quick answer: Italy has three main funding routes",{"id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Quick answer: Italy has three main funding routes"}],[["$","p","International students normally search through three different routes. MAECI is an Italian Government grant with an annual eligible-country list and its own Study in Italy application. Regional right-to-study bodies run income-and-merit benefits usually called DSU. Universities also offer merit scholarships, tuition waivers or programme-specific awards.",{"children":"International students normally search through three different routes. MAECI is an Italian Government grant with an annual eligible-country list and its own Study in Italy application. Regional right-to-study bodies run income-and-merit benefits usually called DSU. Universities also offer merit scholarships, tuition waivers or programme-specific awards."}],["$","p","These routes are not interchangeable. A university offer does not automatically create a DSU award, a MAECI application does not replace admission, and a tuition waiver may leave accommodation and living costs unpaid. Compare the application owner, deadline and covered costs for each route.",{"children":"These routes are not interchangeable. A university offer does not automatically create a DSU award, a MAECI application does not replace admission, and a tuition waiver may leave accommodation and living costs unpaid. Compare the application owner, deadline and covered costs for each route."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","MAECI: government call and eligible-country list",{"children":"MAECI: government call and eligible-country list"}],["$","li","DSU: region-specific income and merit assessment",{"children":"DSU: region-specific income and merit assessment"}],["$","li","University award: admission-linked merit or fee support",{"children":"University award: admission-linked merit or fee support"}],["$","li","Research funding: department, doctoral call or project-specific route",{"children":"Research funding: department, doctoral call or project-specific route"}]]}]]}],["$","section","Current planning status on 29 September 2026",{"id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Current planning status on 29 September 2026"}],[["$","p","The 2026–2027 MAECI call closed on 26 March 2026. ER.GO's main 2026–2027 scholarship deadline passed on 24 August 2026. Those closed dates are useful for planning but must not be reused as future deadlines.",{"children":"The 2026–2027 MAECI call closed on 26 March 2026. ER.GO's main 2026–2027 scholarship deadline passed on 24 August 2026. Those closed dates are useful for planning but must not be reused as future deadlines."}],["$","p","The University of Padua states that its first call for most 2027–2028 degree programmes opened on 15 September 2026 and closes on 15 November 2026. An open admission call does not confirm that every scholarship for that intake is open, so check the scholarship page and the programme factsheet separately.",{"children":"The University of Padua states that its first call for most 2027–2028 degree programmes opened on 15 September 2026 and closes on 15 November 2026. An open admission call does not confirm that every scholarship for that intake is open, so check the scholarship page and the programme factsheet separately."}]],"$undefined"]}],"$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a"]]}]
